              "name": "Note: Mapping Preview",
              "description": "The Data Ingestion Wizard runs the Ingest playbook with\n`vars.request.env_setup == true` while the analyst designs the field\nmapping in the UI. In that mode the first fetched record is returned so\nthe wizard can render the Data Mapping preview; no alerts are written.\n`false` (or missing) is the real ingestion path.\n",
